OL,3,GNEWSACouple spent 20 years making
OL,4,Arailway station garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who have spent 20 years
OL,7,Fbuilding a community garden at their
OL,8,Flocal railway station have said they
OL,9,Fhope it will be named as the Best in
OL,10,FBritain.
OL,12,FHindley Station in Wigan has been
OL,13,Fnominated in an annual "World Cup" of
OL,14,Fstations competition run by train
OL,15,Foperating companies.
OL,17,FSheila and Sandy Davidson have been
OL,18,Fplanting trees, flowers and shrubs
OL,19,Falongside the platforms for two
OL,20,Fdecades.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
