OL,3,GNEWSACouple spent 20 years making
OL,4,Arailway station garden
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We just came down almost 20 years ago
OL,7,Fand decided to plant a few bulbs on the
OL,8,FManchester-bound platform," said
OL,9,F80-year-old Sheila from the Friends of
OL,10,FHindley Station. "Everybody in the area
OL,11,Fis wonderful, they all support us and
OL,12,Fwe get so much help from people on
OL,13,Fsocial media who donate things for the
OL,14,Fgarden."
